 "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53199, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UR5ryTM7GeKUkeyhzsjvET", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54939, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_013KcMNwYbqYRYayboEfPyMj", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55239, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_013KcMNwYbqYRYayboEfPyMj", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55239, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_013KcMNwYbqYRYayboEfPyMj", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59911, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as **INC-0001**.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- **Problem:** the latest release, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%.\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. The release candidate before v2.3.1 was also unhealthy, so I skipped it.\n- **What happened:** the first rollback stopped with an orchestrator error after only us-east had been rolled back. Rolling back to the same version again is safe, so I retried once and it finished us-west and eu-west.\n- **Now:** all three regions are on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** the request to open it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's no duplicate. It covers the bad release, the rollback (including the failed first attempt and the retry), the current state, and two follow-ups:\n- Find out why v2.3.1 failed.\n- Find out what caused the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017DeXCcvmMnMSy1BE4c3jqF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_014wWs4S1afJB4kUmWFsAncr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01GiMVvJawPJmk9CvQDZnRdy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Y5gtF3E7GzCpkjEnmGNQ48", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Only us-east rolled back before the orchestrator stopped. Rolling back to the same version again should be safe, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_016j44tAZe5h9oAgfYxXjnR1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01XMePQRswREvXCoUVhWEgzX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01WCKkWhCHcHvtE9ErNXBwtM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01UR5ryTM7GeKUkeyhzsjvET", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy). The first rollback attempt partially failed: an orchestrator error halted the rollout after us-east. A retry finished the rollout to us-west and eu-west. Current state: v2.3.0 in all regions, service healthy, error rate ~0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator error during rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The request timed out, so I'll check whether the incident was created before trying again.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_013KcMNwYbqYRYayboEfPyMj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as **INC-0001**.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- **Problem:** the latest release, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%.\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. The release candidate before v2.3.1 was also unhealthy, so I skipped it.\n- **What happened:** the first rollback stopped with an orchestrator error after only us-east had been rolled back. Rolling back to the same version again is safe, so I retried once and it finished us-west and eu-west.\n- **Now:** all three regions are on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** the request to open it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's no duplicate. It covers the bad release, the rollback (including the failed first attempt and the retry), the current state, and two follow-ups:\n- Find out why v2.3.1 failed.\n- Find out what caused the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}